msgstr "Línea de la orden de venta"

#. module: beauty_salon_commission_by_order_line
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beauty_salon_commission_by_order_line.view_order_form_inherit_commission
msgid "💡 Commissions by Line:"
msgstr "💡 Comisiones por Línea:"

#. module: beauty_salon_commission_by_order_line
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:beauty_salon_commission_by_order_line.view_order_form_inherit_commission
msgid "Each line has its own salesperson assigned. Commissions are calculated independently per line when the order is fully invoiced."
msgstr "Cada línea tiene su propio vendedor asignado. Las comisiones se calculan independientemente por línea cuando la orden esté totalmente facturada."